<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>You are a Foundation researcher. You have read a lot of articles like this, and therefore have effectively read a <em>lot</em> of scary stories.</p>
<p>Now you read this one. This one, which is all about a scary story <em>summoned by scary stories you know.</em></p>
<p>You are fucking boned.</p>
</div>
</div>
